.stfolder/
# The dev quest rows. Built here, 27MB, and it used to be committed and
# pushed on every change so the few people with the Quest Builder could be
# handed a copy. They fetch them from the server now, and the only copy that
# is read is the one on the machine serving them, outside any checkout. It is
# a build output: if it goes missing the build makes it again.
